{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/banker_wish__1_2.png?t=1741457135\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/223.gif?t=1741457135\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Banker Simulator - Are You Ready to Explore the Challenges of the Financial World?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take over a bankrupt bank and strive to bring it back to life. Make decisions to improve customer satisfaction, make strategic investments, and overcome financial crises. Manage risks, grow your bank, and solidify your position in the industry. In this exciting simulation game, become both a financial expert and a master strategist!<br><br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/moneymachine.gif?t=1741457135\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REALISTIC COUNTERFEIT MONEY PRINTING SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Big profits require big risks! Increase your bank\u2019s influence by printing counterfeit money and laundering it undetected to strengthen your position in the financial world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IDENTITY VERIFICATION &amp; FRAUD DETECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every customer is trustworthy! Verify identities, detect fake documents, and protect your bank\u2019s reputation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LIVE THE LUXURY LIFE \u2013 SPEND, INVEST, AND REACH THE TOP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Banking is just the beginning! Use your earnings to live a luxurious life, make profitable investments, and boost your prestige.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMER SATISFACTION &amp; BANK MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The foundation of a successful bank is trust! Provide top-tier financial services to increase customer satisfaction, secure profitable deals, and build a loyal client base.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CASH MANAGEMENT &amp; TELLER OPERATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage large cash flows and ensure seamless execution of all banking transactions. Every banknote counts!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADD TO WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no limit to how much money you can make! Take control of the financial world, build your banking empire, and rise to the top. <br><br><strong>Banker Simulator add to your\u00a0 ''Wishlist Now''</strong> and be among the first to play! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451020?t=1741457135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741457135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/ccbe774e08bd3133b6030356d4df2ae30d05f8f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741457135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/ccbe774e08bd3133b6030356d4df2ae30d05f8f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741457135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/banker_wish__1_2.png?t=1741457135\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/223.gif?t=1741457135\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Banker Simulator - Are You Ready to Explore the Challenges of the Financial World?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take over a bankrupt bank and strive to bring it back to life. Make decisions to improve customer satisfaction, make strategic investments, and overcome financial crises. Manage risks, grow your bank, and solidify your position in the industry. In this exciting simulation game, become both a financial expert and a master strategist!<br><br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/extras/moneymachine.gif?t=1741457135\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Main Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REALISTIC COUNTERFEIT MONEY PRINTING SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Big profits require big risks! Increase your bank\u2019s influence by printing counterfeit money and laundering it undetected to strengthen your position in the financial world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IDENTITY VERIFICATION &amp; FRAUD DETECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every customer is trustworthy! Verify identities, detect fake documents, and protect your bank\u2019s reputation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LIVE THE LUXURY LIFE \u2013 SPEND, INVEST, AND REACH THE TOP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Banking is just the beginning! Use your earnings to live a luxurious life, make profitable investments, and boost your prestige.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMER SATISFACTION &amp; BANK MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The foundation of a successful bank is trust! Provide top-tier financial services to increase customer satisfaction, secure profitable deals, and build a loyal client base.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CASH MANAGEMENT &amp; TELLER OPERATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage large cash flows and ensure seamless execution of all banking transactions. Every banknote counts!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ADD TO WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no limit to how much money you can make! Take control of the financial world, build your banking empire, and rise to the top. <br><br><strong>Banker Simulator add to your\u00a0 ''Wishlist Now''</strong> and be among the first to play! </p>","developers":["Soi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451020/header.jpg?t=1741457135","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111701,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111701/movie480.mp4?t=1741357316","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111701/movie_max.mp4?t=1741357316"},"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111701/88975957f250800c18ac990dfce2574617f49319/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741357316","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111701/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741357316","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111701/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741357316"}}],"name":"Banker Simulator: Prologue","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> -</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> -</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Red Axe Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas l\u00edcitas\nViol\u00eancia\nAtos criminosos","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"